WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have a stack of cards
right here.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
Each card has the name
of a TV show written on it.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Now, don't grab it yet. Okay.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:05.939 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, okay, okay.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:07.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As soon as you look at
the card, you have 5 seconds

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.275
to describe what the show is
about the best way you can

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
and try to make me
guess which show it is.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't use any words in
the title of the show

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:14.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
or say any of the
actors's names.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.917
You're just describing the plot
of the show in 5 seconds.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:18.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sound good?
-This is like "Taboo."

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.820
I'm good at this. Okay.
-You're good at it? Okay.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.588 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Here we go. You go.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's put 5 seconds
on the clock.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Where's the clock?
-There's the clock.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
You go first. Ready?
-Okay.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Come on, pal. We got this.
-You're going to do the clock.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We got this.
-Okay.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.195 line:92%
-All right. I'll do the clock.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just give me
5 seconds of a summary.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go.
-Great.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dragons.
-"Game of Thrones."

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was a record. 3 seconds.
Dude, you're really good.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I told you.
-You're really good at this.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:41.541 line:92%
-How good are you, Jimmy?

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
